{
  "id": "33730_tatsu",
  "headword": "{発|た}つ",
  "reading": "たつ",
  "romaji": "tatsu",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (godan)",
  "gloss": "to depart; to leave (on a journey)",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to depart; to leave; to set out (on a journey)",
      "explanation": "To leave a place to travel somewhere, especially on a long trip. The place left is marked with を."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "33730_tatsu_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦{明日|あした}→明日：00501_ashita⟧⟦{東京|とうきょう}→東京：09564_toukyou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{発|た}つ。",
      "english": "I leave Tokyo tomorrow.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "33730_tatsu_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{彼|かれ}→彼：01292_kare⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧{朝早|あさはや}く⟦パリ→パリ：25088_pari⟧⟦へ→へ：02473_he⟧{発|た}った。",
      "english": "He left for Paris early in the morning.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "33730_tatsu_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{留学|りゅうがく}→留学：03677_ryuugaku⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦ため→ため：01145_tame⟧⟦{日本|にほん}→日本：03876_nihon⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{発|た}つ⟦{前|まえ}→前：02255_mae⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧、⟦{家族|かぞく}→家族：00552_kazoku⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧⟦{食事|しょくじ}→食事：02087_shokuji⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦した→する：00392_suru⟧。",
      "english": "Before leaving Japan to study abroad, I had dinner with my family.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "A slightly formal, written-leaning verb; in conversation ⟦{出発|しゅっぱつ}する→出発する：01832_shuppatsusuru⟧ or ⟦{出|で}る→出る：00513_deru⟧ is more common.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- [place]⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{発|た}つ: to leave a place\n- [place]⟦へ→へ：02473_he⟧{発|た}つ / ⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{向|む}けて→向ける：02306_mukeru⟧{発|た}つ: to leave for a place\n- ⟦{旅|たび}→旅：03407_tabi⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{発|た}つ: to set out on a journey\n\nWATCH OUT:\nたつ has several spellings. {発|た}つ is departing; ⟦{立|た}つ→立つ：00758_tatsu⟧ is standing (and leaving a seat, ⟦{席|せき}→席：02215_seki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{立|た}つ→立つ：00758_tatsu⟧); ⟦{経|た}つ→経つ：09892_tatsu⟧ is time passing; ⟦{建|た}つ→建つ：12544_tatsu⟧ is a building going up; ⟦{断|た}つ→断つ：27885_tatsu⟧ and ⟦{絶|た}つ→絶つ：31646_tatsu⟧ are cutting off.",
